00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:33,000
Stand your ground.

2
00:10:54,000 --> 00:11:00,000
Green Street Hooligans is a crime, drama film directed by Lexi Alexander.

3
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:27,000
After being wrongfully expelled from Harvard University, American
Matt Buckner flees to his sister's home in England.

4
00:21:48,000 --> 00:21:54,000
Once there, he is befriended by her charming and dangerous brother-in-law, Pete
Dunham, and introduced to the underworld of British football hooliganism.

5
00:27:15,000 --> 00:27:21,000
Matt learns to stand his ground through a friendship that develops
against the backdrop of this secret and often violent world.

6
00:32:42,000 --> 00:32:48,000
'Green Street Hooligans' is a story of loyalty, trust and the
sometimes brutal consequences of living close to the edge.

7
00:38:09,000 --> 00:38:15,000
Matt Buckner, played by Elijah Wood.

8
00:43:36,000 --> 00:43:42,000
Pete Dunham, played by Charlie Hunnam.

9
00:49:03,000 --> 00:49:09,000
Shannon Dunham, played by Claire Forlani.

10
00:54:30,000 --> 00:54:36,000
Steve Dunham, played by Marc Warren.

11
00:59:57,000 --> 01:00:03,000
Bovver, played by Leo Gregory.

12
01:05:24,000 --> 01:05:30,000
Tommy Hatcher, played by Geoff Bell.

13
01:10:51,000 --> 01:10:57,000
Green Street Hooligans (also known as Green Street and Hooligans) is a 2005
crime drama film about football hooliganism in the United Kingdom.

14
01:16:18,000 --> 01:16:24,000
The film is directed by Lexi Alexander and stars Elijah Wood, Charlie
Hunnam, Claire Forlani, Marc Warren, and Leo Gregory.

15
01:21:45,000 --> 01:21:51,000
Two sequels followed in the form of direct-to-video releases.

16
01:27:12,000 --> 01:27:18,000
The first, Green Street 2: Stand Your Ground, was released on various
dates around the world between March 2009 to July 2010.

17
01:32:39,000 --> 01:32:45,000
The second, Green Street 3: Never Back Down, was
released in the UK on 21 October 2013.

18
01:38:06,000 --> 01:38:12,000
The film explores themes of london, england, sports,
harvard university, hooligan, revenge.

19
01:43:33,000 --> 01:43:39,000
The tone is dark and emotional.
